#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/help/help.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<p>VLC media player is a free and open source media player, encoder, and "
"streamer made by the volunteers of the <a href=\"https://www.videolan.org/"
"\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">VideoLAN</"
"span></a> community.</p><p>VLC uses its internal codecs, works on "
"essentially every popular platform, and can read almost all files, CDs, "
"DVDs, network streams, capture cards and other media formats!</p><p><a "
"href=\"https://www.videolan.org/contribute/\"><span style=\" text-"
"decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">Help and join us!</span></a>"
msgstr ""
"<p>El reproductor multimedia VLC es un reproductor multimedia, codificador y "
"emisor libre y de código abierto creado por los voluntarios de la comunidad "
"<a href=\"https://www.videolan.org/\"><span style=\" text-decoration: "
"underline; color:#0057ae;\">VideoLAN</span></a>.</p><p>VLC utiliza sus "
"códecs internos, funciona en prácticamente todas las plataformas populares y "
"puede leer casi todos los archivos, CD, DVD, emisiones de red, tarjetas de "
"captura y otros formatos multimedia.</p><p><a href=\"https://"
"www.videolan.org/contribute/\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; "
"color:#0057ae;\">¡Ayúdenos y únase a nosotros!</span></a>"

